<description>&lt;p&gt;A bomb near a Colombian military base killed four civilians, among them a newborn, while a Venezuelan army strike on an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure killed at least 19 combatants. President De la Espriella is expanding militarization along the Venezuelan border and cutting resources for the human-rights court, limiting its capacity to address abuses. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. These incidents show simultaneous escalation of violence against civilians in Colombia and combatants in Venezuela, and a political shift that reduces accountability mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9RLVIyRmF3c3FqejlDUkFXZUd0VHV5al9GcE9XQW5aQkI5UHdnUnJib01NaUs0V3hzZUtqLUhObGNscm9OZUxqZ2hJVHN3bmtEanhzbXhTZWd1LTVteXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5fWW05WWFRdXd6bFJjVU5RMko0dHdmalg4RWJQeF9HRnRyd1VPS2VrWWF0T0haQ2l2WGppRU5EVE1xZU1PbE1VeFVMWFVVdmhJMXVhQVlvdFV6OHpv?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNREVjOXhzQVc3YV9DUGp6bk90UFl4bllIWF8wendwdUh4WEpsYk5LOXJyVWFiZVN4U1Rub3MzN0piZDJJcmRCRDV3YVo2bTE3VjZ0bl9rbkZ4SlZkVDNaVFZsQU10NzU2VnhNODdzdHkteTdCMHNuSVFVOGFZM3dxT1piZnZKeDk5UzVyLWxyWE83Q09H?oc=5&quot;&gt;Venezuelanalysis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPZmg5eDZscHhDTXpyV2FTNERKMlRhR2ZSaFpTa0N2eXhZM1dPQlJuTGpfQi1ndWg3YzBIdFhRalVtODBtZjFvZW1JWkJEOEkwTkZtMkg2VXZGN0JHNkZnSU04elBOd3A3NWV4VFpUaWxjSnRFcHZhdDU5TENhbVpvTDZFTUgtRVFhZkFJSl9GM2RhMHk3b29faTNtU0VYZmh2NFhaUkRMUXdXZURFdTRj?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxORUZxQ1BvTmZhdkRSWEJ1Qk1WSjVYMFA0Z1JpRWt4dl9hUkNjci1qamZyTm55Q2Vqai1SNERoc0hUdHc2NzJTMXp1WkpIY2ZjSFB